i和TapTap都可以积极参与哦！</p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\" data-filtered=\"filtered\" /></p></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(124, 110, 81); visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;\">点击 阅读原文 查看更多抽奖信息~</p></div>\n</div></div>\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息144.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e7/6s4rub5ond050rdjpqeyfqlkzv34sbu.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF144.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e7/6s4rub5ond050rdjpqeyfqlkzv34sbu.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF144.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e7/6s4rub5ond050rdjpqeyfqlkzv34sbu.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" />\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息145.gif\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cb/r06ik1mdpk07mhw364hbzgr4pn6fkqs.gif\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1078\" height=\"490\" data-file-width=\"1078\" data-file-height=\"490\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021200320\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 104/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 268/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.910      1 -total\n 53.36%   14.892      1 模板:面包屑\n 46.28%   12.918      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_